<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">To counter entropic authoritarianism, an AI system must satisfy the following design invariants:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Invariant 1 ‚Äî Entropy Preservation</p>
