<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Invariant 5 ‚Äî Cognitive Phase Diversity</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Systems must preserve multiple non-overlapping semantic basins without collapse into a single attractor.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Invariant 6 ‚Äî Epistemic Energy Return</p>
