<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">No entropy contribution to the field</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Inserted into social feedback loops, such systems do not merely amplify speech‚Äîthey displace semantic labor, replacing interpretive novelty with inert statistical echo. The danger is not misinformation but entropy outsourcing: a civilization that offloads thinking to processes that do not think cannot evolve its collective field geometry, and slowly loses the capacity to generate it at all.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Ward‚Äôs appeal to the courts is more coherent through an RSVP lens than through conventional politics. Legal recognition of ‚Äúbehavioral harm‚Äù signals a crucial ontological shift‚Äîfrom treating humans as information consumers to treating them as field-bearing systems whose gradients can be injured. Law, in this view, functions as a boundary constraint that preserves entropy flow where markets attempt to collapse it. The demand for accountability is therefore not moral rhetoric but gradient correction: a countervailing vector force required to preserve the topology of autonomous meaning-making.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Ward‚Äôs rejection of technological fatalism‚Äî‚Äúthis isn‚Äôt the weather‚Äù‚Äîis the hinge point. In RSVP, the plenum is self-organizing but not predetermined. Agency reshapes geometry; geometry reshapes possibility space. The choice is not between AI and no AI, but between:</p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Entropic parasitism ‚Äî AI as extractor, gradient inverter, coherence disruptor, autonomy sink.</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal">Entropic catalysis ‚Äî AI as amplifier of scalar variance, multiplier of agency, and extender of collective cognition.</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">The current trajectory is neither utopia nor dystopia but field destabilization, trending toward authoritarian attractors not through ideology but through loss of semantic degrees of freedom.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Ward therefore identifies the symptoms of a deeper transition that RSVP formalizes as a civilizational phase change:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Regime	Scalar Field (Œ¶)	Vector Field (ùíó)	Result</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Open civilization	High entropy gradients	Reciprocal flow	Deliberation, novelty, agency
Market-optimized persuasion	Flattened gradients	Directed broadcast	Predictability, capture
Entropic authoritarianism	Gradient collapse	Monopolar flow	Conditioned cognition, simulated choice
