<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">From this view, the defense of freedom is not a matter of regulating platforms or protecting discourse alone. It is the larger physical requirement of maintaining a non-degenerate entropy landscape in collective semantic space. Authoritarianism is not the seizure of the state‚Äîit is the contraction of meaning.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">The core question, therefore, is not whether humans remain free, but whether civilization can remain thermodynamically alive to its own future.</p>
