<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><strong class="font-semibold">Definition 3 (Capture Region):</strong> A connected region <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>‚äÇ</mo><mi mathvariant="script">M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R \subset \mathcal{M}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.7224em; vertical-align: -0.0391em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">‚äÇ</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord mathcal">M</span></span></span></span> where <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àá</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">Œ¶</mi><mo>‚Üí</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla \Phi \to 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">‚àáŒ¶</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">‚Üí</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span> and <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àá</mi><mo>‚ãÖ</mo><mi mathvariant="bold">v</mi><mo>‚âàÃ∏</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla \cdot \mathbf{v} \not\approx 0</annotation></semantics></math></span>