st-child]:mt-0"><p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Here is a scholarly annotated bibliography tailored to your paper‚Äôs conceptual architecture, written in academic prose and explicitly linking each source to the RSVP interpretation of behavioral capture and entropic authoritarianism.</p>
