<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">RSVP formalizes civilizational dynamics as phase transitions in the </span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">(</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\Phi</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">, \mathbf{v})</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> field, analogous to thermodynamic critical points </span><span style="color: rgb(197, 134, 192);">\parencite</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{prigogine1984order}. Control parameters include corporate concentration </span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">c</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> (monopole strength) and engagement optimization intensity </span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\beta</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> (entropy inversion rate). The phase diagram features four regimes:</span></span>
