<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Ward's diagnosis, formalized in RSVP, reveals entropic authoritarianism as a contraction of meaning, not state seizure </span><span style="color: rgb(197, 134, 192);">\parencite</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{arendt1951totalitarianism}. Freedom demands sustaining non-degenerate semantic curvature. Beyond Ward's legal constraints and Zuboff's regulatory focus, RSVP mandates coherence-positive design to keep collective cognition thermodynamically viable </span><span style="color: rgb(197, 134, 192);">\parencite</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{prigogine1984order}. The question is whether civilization preserves entropy flux against inversion, ensuring an open future.</span></span>
