<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">The transmitter of autonomy is not </span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\Phi</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> itself, but its gradient </span><span style="color: rgb(197, 134, 192);">\cite</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{landauer1961irreversibility}.</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
