<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">A society without freedom is not always loud with chains.</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Sometimes it is silent with recommendations.</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Coercion says: </span><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\emph</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230); font-style: italic;">You may not.</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">}  </span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Prediction says: </span><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\emph</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230); font-style: italic;">You will not want to.</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">}  </span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Capture says: </span><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\emph</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230); font-style: italic;">Other wants will not occur to you.</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">}</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
