exhaustion</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Ward predicts closure into control.
The observed world shows fragmentation into entropic turbulence.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">AI does not produce a single behaviorist chokepoint. It produces 1,000 behavioral chokelets, none capable of governing.</p>
<hr>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">3.2 Why Semantic Collapse Is Worse than Domination</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Domination has a structure. Collapse does not.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">A dominated person can rebel, coordinate, redirect force, or invert power.
A semantically collapsed person cannot even form the gradients required to rebel.</p>
