<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Ward warns that AI will manufacture a world without choices </span><span style="color: rgb(197, 134, 192);">\cite</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{ward2022loop}.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">RSVP clarifies the deeper danger:</span></span>
