&amp;_h2:not(.not-prose):first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;_h3:not(.not-prose):first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;_h4:not(.not-prose):first-child]:mt-0"><p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Just these appendices: Appendix A ‚Äî Derivation of the Critical Capture Threshold</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">We begin with the scalar field evolution under capture:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\frac{\partial \Phi}{\partial t} = D_\Phi \nabla^2 \Phi - \beta \Phi</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Assume Fourier modes of the form:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\Phi(x,t) = \sum_k \hat{\Phi}_k e^{i k x + \lambda_k t}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Then:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\lambda_k \hat{\Phi}<span>*k = -D*</span>\Phi k^2 \hat{\Phi}_k - \beta \hat{\Phi}_k</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\lambda_k = -D_\Phi k^2 - \beta</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Stability requires  for all .
Semantic collapse occurs when the least stable mode reaches zero:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\lambda_{k_{\min}} = 0</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">On a domain of size , the lowest nonzero mode is:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">k_{\min} = \frac{\pi}{L}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Thus the transition point  satisfies:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">0 = -D_\Phi \left(\frac{\pi}{L}\right)^2 - \beta_c</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\boxed{ \beta_c = \frac{D_\Phi \pi^2}{L^2} }</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">This gives a concrete, measurable collapse threshold in terms of:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Parameter	Meaning in society</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;semantic mobility, education, cognitive cross-pollination
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;characteristic cultural diameter (how far ideas must travel to matter)
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;capture pressure (ads, polarization, rage/reward loops, algorithmic profiling)</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Collapse happens not when ideas vanish, but when they cannot propagate far enough to recombine.</p>
<hr>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Appendix B ‚Äî Pseudocode Simulation of Semantic Turbulence</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">A minimal simulation of the coupled fields with capture:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">initialize Œ¶, v on 2D lattice
for t in timesteps:
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;noiseŒ¶ = Œ∑ * random()
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;noiseV = Œ∑ * random_vector()</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Œ¶ += dt * (DŒ¶ * laplacian(Œ¶) - Œ≤ * Œ¶ + noiseŒ¶)
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;v += dt * (Dv * laplacian(v) - Œ≤ * v + grad(Œ¶) + noiseV)</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;# Optional anti-capture operators
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;if enable_divergence:
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Œ¶ += Œ± * divergence(grad(Œ¶))
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;if enable_circulation:
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;v += Œ≥ * curl(v)
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;if enable_reentropize:
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Œ¶ += œÉ * noise_boundary(Œ¶)</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Key observables to track:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">semantic_variance = var(Œ¶)
agency_energy     = mean(|v|^2)
gradient_flux     = mean(|grad(Œ¶)|)
capture_index     = mean(Œ≤ * |Œ¶|)
manifold_health   = gradient_flux / capture_index</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Interpretation:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Healthy society: gradient_flux &gt;&gt; capture_index</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Captured society: capture_index &gt; gradient_flux</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Terminal collapse: semantic_variance ‚Üí 0</p>
<hr>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Appendix C ‚Äî Empirical Observables for Behavioral Capture</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Observable	Measurable Proxy	Collapse Indicator</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Semantic variance 	diversity of distinct viewpoints	trending to 0
Gradient flux ÓÄÅ	\nabla \Phi	ÓÄÅ
Capture index ÓÄÅC = \beta	\Phi	ÓÄÅ
Agency circulation 	reciprocal community action	breaks into sinks
Noise turbulence 	volume of uncorrelated outrage/distraction	exceeds coherence</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">A civilization is not healthy when it is calm, but when:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">|\nabla \Phi| \gg C</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Meaning: possibilities diverge faster than they are harvested.</p>
<hr>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Appendix D ‚Äî Design Criteria for Anti-Capture AI</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">An AI system is anti-capture aligned if it satisfies:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Requirement	Formal condition	Meaning</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Increases possibility	maximize ÓÄÅ\int	\nabla \Phi
Preserves agency loops		no creation of dependency sinks
Disrupts attractors, not gradients	noise on basins only	breaks cages not compasses
Non-predictive stance	models futures, not users	refuses behavioral freezing
Non-monopolar flow	decentralized vector sources	avoids agency singularity</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">This is the inversion of modern recommender systems.</p>
<hr>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Appendix E ‚Äî Case Studies in Semantic Collapse</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">E1: Twitter (X)</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">High noise</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">High capture</p>
