<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Result: stable attractor vortices, adversarial polarization, low cross-gradient mixing</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">E2: TikTok</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Extreme predictive capture</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Semantic variance appears high but is synthetic, low</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Illusion of diversity, collapse of recombination</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Not authoritarian, but terminally pacifying</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">E3: LLM Consumer Chat</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Removes search cost but also removes gradient search</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Answers given, not discovered</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Agency becomes prompt-shaped not trajectory-shaped</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">E4: News Ecosystem</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Click optimization ‚âà capture maximization</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Output constrained to emotional eigenspectra</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Collapse of slow meaning, dominance of fast valence</p>
<hr>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Appendix F ‚Äî Glossary of Cognitive Field Terms</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Term	Meaning</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Capture field 	pressure toward predictability and compliance
Scalar field 	space of uncollapsed possible meanings
Vector field 	agency flow, intention propagation
Semantic curvature	ability for ideas to bend into new forms
Entropic authoritarianism	collapse via noise instead of force
Monopolar agency	control via singular vector sources
Re-entropization	breaking attractors to restore gradients
Semantic death	gradients vanish, variance ‚Üí 0
Plenum	the coupled cognitive space of all agents</p>
<hr>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Final Appendix Statement</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words">
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Collapse is not the loss of freedom.
Collapse is the loss of the mathematical preconditions for freedom.</p>
</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Freedom does not disappear when choices vanish ‚Äî
