\section{Appendix A ‚Äî Scalar‚ÄìVector Dynamical System Details}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">In the RSVP formalism, cognitive and sociotechnical dynamics evolve by coupled PDEs:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\begin{align}
\frac{\partial \Phi}{\partial t} &amp;= D_\Phi \nabla^2 \Phi - \alpha \Phi S + \eta_\Phi(x,t),\
\frac{\partial \vec{v}}{\partial t} &amp;= -\gamma \vec{v} + \beta \nabla \Phi + \vec{\eta}_v(x,t),\
\frac{\partial S}{\partial t} &amp;= D_S \nabla^2 S + \lambda |\nabla \cdot \vec{v}| - \mu S + \eta_S(x,t).
\end{align}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Where:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\begin{itemize}
\item <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Œ¶</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6833em;"></span><span class="mord">Œ¶</span></span></span></span> is cognitive potential (semantic openness),
