<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">leading to \textbf{entropic well formation}, a basin in which choice collapses to a small set of predicted attractors.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">A critical regime exists when:</p>
