<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Collapse happens not when ideas vanish, but when they cannot propagate far enough to recombine </span><span style="color: rgb(197, 134, 192);">\cite</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{bridle2018darkage}.</span></span>
