<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Where the theory remains under-specified</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">A. Measurement theory is undeveloped</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">The key fields () are mathematically defined but empirically undefined.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">The central circularity is:</p>
