</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Without this, field collapse is conceptually coherent but not diagnosable in practice.</p>
<hr>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">B. Agency destruction is not modeled, only agency drift</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">The current dynamics assume agents descend semantic gradients.
Reality contains gradient annihilators:</p>
