<hr>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">C. The conservation claim is too strong</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">The conservation of ‚Äúviable future minds‚Äù relies on:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">a closed semantic manifold</p>
