<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">But capture is defined by violation of incompressibility and societies are open systems.
A more defensible replacement is a dissipation bound, e.g.:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\frac{d}{dt} \int |\nabla \Phi|, d\mu \ge - \Gamma(\beta, D_\Phi, L)</p>
