<hr>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">D. The genesis of semantic possibility is untheorized</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">The framework models loss and restoration of possibility but not production.
Three incompatible sources are implicitly conflated:</p>
