<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Which one next?Below is a clean, publication-ready Related Work section written in academic prose, designed to drop directly into your LaTeX document. It situates RSVP relative to neighboring literatures while emphasizing its unique contributions and avoids diagrammatic or overly illustrative phrasing.</p>
