<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">RSVP states the real pathology plainly:</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\textit</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230); font-style: italic;">Authoritarianism limits behavior. Entropic collapse deletes agency.</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">}</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
