<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">A civilization is not healthy when it is calm, but when:</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">\[</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">|</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\nabla</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);"> \Phi</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">| </span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\gg</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);"> C</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">\]</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Meaning: possibilities diverge faster than they are harvested </span><span style="color: rgb(197, 134, 192);">\cite</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{shannon1948mathematical}.</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
