<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">\]</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Human discourse exhibits mixed curvature (</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">\mathcal{K} &gt; </span><span style="color: rgb(181, 206, 168);">0</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> generative regions, </span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">\mathcal{K} &lt; </span><span style="color: rgb(181, 206, 168);">0</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> exploratory regions).</span></span>
