<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Our regime (now) </span><span style="color: rgb(197, 134, 192);">&amp;</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);"> $</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\beta</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">_i &gt; </span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\beta</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">_c</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> across many agencies </span><span style="color: rgb(197, 134, 192);">&amp;</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> No lock-in, only noise, volatility, exhaustion </span><span style="color: rgb(197, 134, 192);">\cite</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{bridle2018darkage} </span><span style="color: rgb(197, 134, 192);">\\</span></span>
