<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\textit</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230); font-style: italic;">Chaotic capture</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">} </span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\rightarrow</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);"> \textit</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230); font-style: italic;">semantic collapse</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">} </span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\rightarrow</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);"> \textit</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230); font-style: italic;">learned helplessness</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">}</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Therefore AI systems that increase stability are not the threat.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">AI systems that amplify micro-capture and noise are the threat </span><span style="color: rgb(197, 134, 192);">\cite</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{bridle2018darkage}.</span></span>
