<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">A free society is not one in which all agents agree, but one in which no agent permanently loses the ability to reconstruct their own gradient of meaning </span><span style="color: rgb(197, 134, 192);">\cite</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{ellul1965propaganda}.</span></span>
