<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">leading to </span><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\textbf</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214); font-weight: bold;">entropic well formation</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">}, a basin in which choice collapses to a small set of predicted attractors.</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
