<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">These equations provide a tractable route to simulate RSVP collapse modes and to compute critical system sizes below which instabilities are suppressed ‚Äî directly borrowing methodology and numerics from the h-NRCH literature.</span></span>
