<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\chapter{Algorithmic Capture as a Control System}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\section{State‚ÄìControl Formulation}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Define the cognitive state and control input:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\begin{align}
\mathbf{x}(t) &amp;=
&nbsp;&nbsp;\begin{bmatrix}
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\Phi(x,t) \
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\mathbf{v}(x,t)
&nbsp;&nbsp;\end{bmatrix}, &amp;
\mathbf{u}(t) &amp;=
&nbsp;&nbsp;\begin{bmatrix}
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\beta(x,t) \
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\gamma(x,t)
&nbsp;&nbsp;\end{bmatrix}
\end{align}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">where:</p>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>Œ≤</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05278em;">Œ≤</span></span></span></span> is algorithmic steerage pressure (semantic compression),</li>
<li class="break-words whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;&gt;ul]:whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;ol]:whitespace-normal"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>Œ≥</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05556em;">Œ≥</span></span></span></span> is attention damping (agency dissipation).</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">The controlled RSVP dynamics become:</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\begin{align}
\partial_t \Phi &amp;= D_\Phi \nabla^2 \Phi - \beta , \Phi + \nabla\cdot \mathbf{v} \
\partial_t \mathbf{v} &amp;= D_v \nabla^2 \mathbf{v} + \nabla \Phi - \gamma \mathbf{v}
\end{align}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Compactly:</p>
