"height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mbin mtight">‚àó</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose">)</span></span></span></span>.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">The spectrum satisfies:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>œÉ</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence="true">{</mo><msub><mi>Œª</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àá</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>‚àí</mo><msup><mi>Œ≤</mi><mo>‚àó</mo></msup><mo separator="true">,</mo><mtext>‚ÄÖ‚Ää</mtext><msub><mi>Œª</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àá</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>‚àí</mo><msup><mi>Œ≥</mi><mo>‚àó</mo></msup><mo fence="true">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma(A + BK) =
