<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\epigraph{``First the variance shrinks, then the meaning.''}{J. Gleick (reframed)}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Semantic collapse describes a measurable transition from high-curvature fields to flat fields. Let</p>
