<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\chapter{Alignment Without Collapse}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\epigraph{``Alignment is not agreement; it is a non-zero curvature guarantee.''}{M. Valerian (declarative)}</p>
