<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\chapter{The Macropatterns of Institutional Forgetting}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\epigraph{``Memory failure is not deletion, but flattening.''}{S. Mittelstadt (reframed)}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Collective memory is modeled as curvature hysteresis:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="script">H</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>‚à´</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup><msub><mo>‚à´</mo><mi mathvariant="script">M</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence="true">‚à£</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àÇ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àÇ</mi><mi>œÑ</mi></mrow></mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àá</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Œ¶</mi><mo fence="true">‚à£</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>Œº</mi><mtext>‚Äâ</mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>œÑ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}(t) = \int_0^t \int_{\mathcal{M}} \left| \frac{\partial}{\partial \tau} \nabla^2 \Phi \right| d\mu\, d\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;"></span><span class="mord mathcal" style="margin-right: 0.00965em;">H</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 2.4935em; vertical-align: -0.95em;"></span><span class="mop"><span class="mop op-symbol large-op" style="margin-right: 0.44445em; position: relative; top: -0.0011em;">‚à´</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.5435em;"><span style="top: -1.7881em; margin-left: -0.4445em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">0</span></span></span><span style="top: -3.8129em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="heigh