<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\begin{theorem}[Institutional Amnesia]
\begin{boxed}
A system exhibits institutional forgetting if:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>‚Å°</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>‚Üí</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àû</mi></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant="script">H</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àû</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lim_{t \to \infty} \mathcal{H}(t) &lt; \infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.45em; vertical-align: -0.7em;"></span><span class="mop op-limits"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6944em;"><span style="top: -2.4em; margin-left: 0em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span><span class="mrel mtight">‚Üí</span><span class="mord mtight">‚àû</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span><span class="mop">lim</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.7em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord mathcal" style="margin-right: 0.00965em;">H</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">&lt;</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord">‚àû</span></span></span></span></span>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">and simultaneously</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>‚Å°</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>‚Üí</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àû</mi></mrow></munder><mi mathvariant="normal">‚à•</mi><msup><mi mathvariant="normal">‚àá</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant="normal">Œ¶</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">‚à•</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lim_{t \to \infty} \|\nabla^2 \Phi(t)\| = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 1.5641em; vertical-align: -0.7em;"></span><span class="mop op-limits"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6944em;"><span style="top: -2.4em; margin-left: 0em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">t</span><span class="mrel mtight">‚Üí</span><span class="mord mtight">‚àû</span></span></span></span><span style="top: -3em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span><span class="mop">lim</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.7em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">‚à•</span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">‚àá</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.8641em;"><span style="top: -3.113em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mord">Œ¶</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal">t</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mord">‚à•</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">=</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6444em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span></span></span></span></span>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\end{boxed}
\end{theorem}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\begin{proof}
Finite curvature hysteresis implies no long-range memory of deformation, and vanishing curvature implies no remaining semantic distinguishability to record or transmit.
\end{proof}</p>
