<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Ward is right that behavioral capture is occurring </span><span style="color: rgb(197, 134, 192);">\cite</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{ward2022loop}.</span></span>
